;    1: TDecorate(count=402, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=そうめい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=155, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=・・・, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=949, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=859, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\川辺.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-dono</STYLE>, I take it there are many people in Tokyo who are interested in the West, like <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, there are some like that among the men. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But women like that are, as you might expect, hard to find..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then, <STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-dono</STYLE>, you exchange opinions with the men as well?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Of course not. Such a thing would be impossible. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">All that is asked of a woman is to become a good wife to a man."</STYLE><PG>
"I see... That's a waste. 
{PAUSE ""}
There are foolish men, and there are <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="そうめい">wise</STYLE> women. 
{PAUSE ""}
Surely that's the same in Tokyo and in Arata. 
{PAUSE ""}
If you have the will and the passion, I'd think it makes no difference whether you're a man or a woman, but..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is that really so? Ever since I was a child, I've always been scolded while I read my books. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So I always carry some sense of guilt... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What kind of women are there in Arata?"</STYLE><PG>
"In our settlement, a woman called the Grand Witch leads the settlement as its head. 
{PAUSE ""}
To be the Grand Witch, of course, you need not only <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="そうめい">wisdom</STYLE> but foresight and the trust of the people. 
{PAUSE ""}
The Grand Witch is the very crystallization of the settlement's wisdom and knowledge."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's amazing... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">To think even a woman can make such a mark..."</STYLE><PG>
"But if this country's Westernization goes on like this, I think an age will surely come when women can make their mark too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Do you think so...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"............?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Even if it were so, the women who could truly make their mark would truly be only a very few. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">A daughter of townsfolk like me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Besides..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Besides, I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm getting married next month."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Married, are you..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. Once that happens, I probably won't be able to read books freely anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">To support her husband, raise the children and work for the household is a woman's duty. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Now... my playing around is over, too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So, </STYLE>Ko-sama<STYLE ID="1">, I think this will be the last time I can talk with you like this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So that was it..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ko-sama<STYLE ID="3"> simply turned his eyes to the flow of the river.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">A river flows from upstream to downstream.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">One cannot go against that flow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">One cannot go against this law of nature.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I am the same.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A woman is one who works for her husband.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Going against custom that has held for hundreds of years―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What am I thinking?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Why, just now, did I think of </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="・・・">going against</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> custom?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">After all... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I...</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
